.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local agent skills/config. Personal settings stay out, and so do the third-party skills
# themselves — `skills-lock.json` is tracked instead, so a collaborator reproduces the same tooling
# with `npx skills` rather than us vendoring (and re-licensing) someone else's work. The project's
# own e2e suite IS tracked: it is test code for this product, not reinstallable tooling. Written as
# .claude/* (not .claude/) since git cannot re-include anything under an excluded directory.
.agents/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/mirror-e2e/
.claude/skills/mirror-e2e/build/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.log

# Keep source and required app assets tracked.
!android/app/src/main/assets/
!android/app/src/main/assets/input_mirror/
!android/app/src/main/assets/input_mirror/input_mirror
